# Copy to .env. For the iOS Simulator (and a browser on this machine) the local
# development backend is http://localhost:8000.
#
# The development Docker Compose publishes the backend on 127.0.0.1 only, so a
# physical phone cannot reach it over the LAN (on a phone, localhost is the phone
# itself). Opening the development server to the network is a deliberate security
# trade-off this repository does not set up for you; see README.md, "Yerel
# geliştirme: ağ erişimi ve JWT anahtarı".
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
